  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF: Development of the Monitoring, Evaluation, and Learning (MEL) System for the Counter Terrorism Portfolio (CTPf)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development of the Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) System for the Counter Terrorism Portfolio (CTPf) project is a monitoring, evaluation and learning technical advisory service, which supports the Counter Terrorism Programme Portfolio (CTPf), to strengthen its mechanisms and capabilities to manage results; enhance evidence-based programming decisions; improve the ability of Programme and Project leads to learn from experience and evidence; and bolster internal communication on the impact achieved, including with senior decision makers.</narrative>
  </description>
